The MCP server (mcp_sse.py) defines the render_chart tool that the Claude agent calls. We're extending it to support both Plotly and Vega-Lite. The agent will call it with library="vegalite" and spec={...} for Vega-Lite, or library="plotly" (default) with data=[...] and layout={...} for Plotly.

